  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7425001",
      "subQuestName": "Head for the vicinity of Hotel Bouffes d'ete to begin the tea party",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "742500101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "742500101": {
            "id": "742500101",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Come to think of it, I wasn't the most attentive host when you visited Snezhnaya before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500102"
            ]
          },
          "742500102": {
            "id": "742500102",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "There's no need for that, Lady Sandrone. Even if we never sat down for a chat, you always provided us with the best refreshments.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500103"
            ]
          },
          "742500103": {
            "id": "742500103",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "*sigh* My apologies. I was too busy back then. I'll be sure to take better care of you the next time you visit.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500104"
            ]
          },
          "742500104": {
            "id": "742500104",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "Mm. You never let me try out your inventions before, either.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500105"
            ]
          },
          "742500105": {
            "id": "742500105",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "There were different reasons for that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500106"
            ]
          },
          "742500106": {
            "id": "742500106",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "Hmph...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500107"
            ]
          },
          "742500107": {
            "id": "742500107",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "Freminet",
            "text": "Actually, Father told us not to disturb you wherever possible.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500108"
            ]
          },
          "742500108": {
            "id": "742500108",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Don't worry about that, I don't mind the occasional disturbance. You can come for tea whenever you feel like it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500109"
            ]
          },
          "742500109": {
            "id": "742500109",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "Freminet",
            "text": "Really? A—Actually... I've always wanted to ask you to take a look at Pers... I have some ideas for improvements that I'd like to run past you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500110"
            ]
          },
          "742500110": {
            "id": "742500110",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Sure thing, that is my area of expertise, after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500111"
            ]
          },
          "742500111": {
            "id": "742500111",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "Freminet",
            "text": "...Thank you, Lady Sandrone!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500112"
            ]
          },
          "742500112": {
            "id": "742500112",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "Mm. Is being a Harbinger really so tough?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500113"
            ]
          },
          "742500113": {
            "id": "742500113",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "When you put it like that... I suppose it is a little. There's a lot to consider. Though most of my frustrations stem from my colleagues...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500114"
            ]
          },
          "742500114": {
            "id": "742500114",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "Freminet",
            "text": "So that must mean... that getting along with others is a must-have skill?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500115"
            ]
          },
          "742500115": {
            "id": "742500115",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "I suppose so... But I doubt you have much to worry about in that regard. At least, Lyney certainly doesn't.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500116"
            ]
          },
          "742500116": {
            "id": "742500116",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Haha, you flatter me, Lady Sandrone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500117"
            ]
          },
          "742500117": {
            "id": "742500117",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Do you want to be a Harbinger? Actually... Never mind. It's not my place to ask. Just pretend I said nothing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500118"
            ]
          },
          "742500118": {
            "id": "742500118",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Hmm... That's all a little far off for me. I'm certainly in no rush to think about it yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500119"
            ]
          },
          "742500119": {
            "id": "742500119",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "Lynette",
            "text": "If you became a Harbinger, wouldn't that mean you'd have no time to accompany us on missions?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500120"
            ]
          },
          "742500120": {
            "id": "742500120",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "Freminet",
            "text": "In that case... Would that mean... Lynette and I would have to become Harbingers, too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500121"
            ]
          },
          "742500121": {
            "id": "742500121",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "I told you, stuff like that is too far off to think about!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500122"
            ]
          },
          "742500122": {
            "id": "742500122",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "Lyney",
            "text": "Besides, no matter where I go, I'll never leave you two behind. I promise.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "742500123"
            ]
          },
          "742500123": {
            "id": "742500123",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Hah... Sometimes I really envy this little family you have."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7425002",
      "subQuestName": "Head for the vicinity of Hotel Bouffes d'ete to begin the tea party",
      "sceneId": null,
